  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>The Southern Cross University (SCU) in Australia is a great place for your studies abroad. The International Student Barometer (ISB) ranking rated Southern Cross University very highly in terms of the satisfaction levels expressed by international students.&nbsp;</p><p>At this university, you'll find diverse programmes in business, health, and environmental studies. Also, they've got a unique teaching method called the Southern Cross Model. It helps you gain an immersive learning experience with fabulous interactivity and real-world applications. Overall, you've come to the right place: an innovative institution known for its strong focus on practical learning and research.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student life",
      "value": "<p>You're going to have a fabulous student life at Southern Cross University. Your life here will be extremely supportive and dynamic, with a great balance of academic and social experiences. They've got campuses in coastal locations, and we're sure that you’ll enjoy activities like surfing and hiking! With the utmost welcoming environment at SCU, you’ll have a very smooth transition to Australian life.&nbsp;</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>At SCU, you'll have a variety of accommodation options, both on-campus and off-campus, that will suit your preferences. Their on-campus housing includes fully furnished, modern apartments with single and shared rooms with high-speed internet, dedicated study areas, and social spaces for you. Their off-campus housing is arranged through partnerships in nearby areas to the university. With 24/7 security and various social events for residents, you’ll love the sense of community at SCU.</p><p>If you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, <a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\">download our app</a> and check out the Stays feature!</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong></p><p>The up-to-date libraries across SCU campuses will help you with a broad range of resources to excel in your academics. You'll have access to digital and physical books, journals, and study spaces. SCU also offers research assistance, study workshops, and a peaceful environment to focus on your university assignments.</p><p><strong>Sports</strong></p><p>SCU offers a variety of sports and fitness opportunities for you. With team sports, fitness classes, and outdoor activities, you have a wide range of recreational activities to choose from. The interesting sporting events, such as Coffs Coast Ocean Swims, Byron Bay Surf Camps, triathlons, and more, are sure to keep you engaged. There’s something for everyone to stay active at SCU.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong></p><p>Southern Cross University has specialised labs for science, health, and engineering fields, all equipped with state-of-the-art facilities. Whatever your chosen field, you'll gain hands-on experience in your subject. The lab facilities focus on providing the best practical experience to make you job-ready.</p><p><strong>Cafeteria</strong></p><p>At SCU, you'll easily have access to a range of food choices, including vegetarian and gluten-free options. Cafeterias at SCU are the perfect space to socialise, relax, and interact with your friends at the university. The cafeterias here always offer fresh, healthy meals.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
  ],
